SUMMARY:🕯️ J Yahrzeit reminder
DTSTART:20251005T163000
DTEND:20251005T163000
UID:reminder-20251005-61a789d7-10
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
DESCRIPTION:Hebcal joins you in remembering J\, whose 24th Yahrzeit occurs
  on Monday\, October 6\, corresponding to the 14th of Tishrei\, 5786.\n\nJ
 ’s Yahrzeit begins at sundown on Sunday\, October 5 and continues until 
 sundown on the day of observance. It is customary to light a memorial cand
 le at dusk as the Yahrzeit begins.\n\nMay your loved one’s soul be bound
  up in the bond of eternal life and may their memory serve as a continued 
 source of inspiration and comfort to you.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Event reminder
TRIGGER:P0DT0H0M0S
END:VALARM
